                    |動画を先生が作成して毎月お届け
                .englp-section-solution-grid-content-left-merits 
                  .englp-section-solution-grid-content-left-merits-list  
                    .englp-section-solution-grid-content-left-merits-list-icon
                        img(src=IcnCheckPerple)
                    .englp-section-solution-grid-content-left-merits-list-text  
